      "start_seconds": 47.53,
      "end_seconds": 82.6,
      "duration_seconds": 35.07,
      "text": "Headaches most days goes along with it, uh, most of the time. As for Headaches most days, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before. With Headaches most days, it happens on and off. And taking painkillers every day, too. With taking painkillers every day, I'd say on and off."
