      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.59,
      "end_seconds": 304.47,
      "duration_seconds": 11.88,
      "text": "Hm, okay. Yes, migraines is known to us, good to have that clear. So where does that leave us? I'd lean towards medication-overuse headache on a background of migraine."
