      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.85,
      "end_seconds": 374.9,
      "duration_seconds": 31.05,
      "text": "I'd like you to take amitriptyline, 10 milligrams, at night, long term. That's for headache prevention. Stop the daily painkillers gradually, the headaches may worsen for a couple of weeks first. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. I'll want another look in six weeks. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
